    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR6q0003-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Hé bù guīlái? 」 "Why not return?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">Shī duì yuē︰ The master replied:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-13T15:24:09.528+09:00">「Hēi. 」 "Dark."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">Then Lóng lit a candle and gave it to the master.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">The master intended to take it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">but Lóng immediately blew it out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">The master then bowed in reverence.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">Lóng said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">"What did you see?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">He said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">"From now on,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">I will no longer doubt the tongues of the old monks in the world."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">The next day,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">he departed.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">Lóngtán said to his disciples:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">"Among you there is a man</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">whose teeth are like a forest of swords,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">and mouth like a blood basin,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">who will not turn his head back after being struck once with a staff.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:51:13.01+09:00">In the future, he will establish my way on the summit of a solitary peak."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">"However, even so,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">it must not be done carelessly."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">He then arranged himself with dignified bearing,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">and made two more obeisances.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">Only after stepping across the threshold,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">did he pick up his sitting cloth</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">and call out,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">"Héshang!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">Wéishān intended to take up his whisk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">but the master shouted at him</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_015-0317b.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T15:52:14.669+09:00">and flung his sleeves, exiting.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">Qiě mèi ěr yì bùdé;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">if you truly have not attained it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">it is not permissible to conveniently push you aside.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">"Brothers, all of you are those who have worn out straw sandals,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">abandoned teachers and monks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">and parents to travel;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">you must truly apply some brilliance to truly attain it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">If there is a place to enter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">encountering someone who bites like pigs and dogs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">not sparing your life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">entering mud and water to help each other,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">having something to chew on,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">sticking it onto your eyebrows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">hanging your alms bowls high,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">breaking your staffs,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">for ten or twenty years,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">intending to achieve thorough understanding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">do not worry about not succeeding.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">Even if you do not achieve thorough understanding in this life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357b.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">you will not lose your human form in the next life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">and in this path, you will also save effort,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">not vainly betraying your life,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">nor betraying your teachers and monks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">parents,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">and the donors from the ten directions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">"You must pay attention,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">do not idly wander through prefectures and counties,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:36:13.506+09:00">carrying your staffs horizontally,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Traveling twelve thousand *lǐ* to take advantage,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">wintering on this side,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">summering on that side,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">good scenery to take as your nature,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">many vegetarian offerings,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">easy to obtain a robe and bowl.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">What suffering!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Planning for a single grain of rice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">losing half a year's worth of provisions.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">What benefit is there in such pilgrimage?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">How do faithful *dànyuè* digest grains of vegetables and rice?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">You must examine yourselves directly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Time waits for no one.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Suddenly one day your eyes fall to the ground,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">what will you use to meet what comes before you?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Don't be like a crab dropped in hot water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">hands and feet flustered,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">with no place for you to bluff and boast.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Do not idly waste time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">once you lose this human body,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">it will be lost for ten thousand *jié*.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">This is no small matter,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">don't rely on the present.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">The ancients still said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">"If I hear the *Dào* in the morning,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">I can die in the evening!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">How much more so we *shāmén*,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">what is it that we should be practicing day and night?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">You must exert yourselves greatly!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Exert yourselves!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_019-0357c.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:37:04.261+09:00">Treasure this!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0367c.127" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">How much more should one benefit sentient beings?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0367c.128" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">Moreover, the world is like</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">bubbles and illusions,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">how can one cling to life? "</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">Thereupon, he stopped lecturing</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">and intended to throw himself into the water,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">to feed creatures with scales and shells.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">As he was about to go,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">two meditation practitioners met him and spoke kindly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">saying:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">"There are many knowledgeable teachers in the South,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">why do you linger in a corner?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">From this point, the Master changed his mind and sought out instruction.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">Because the passes and ferries were tightly guarded,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">he said to the guard official:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">"I am not seeking to enjoy mountains and rivers,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">but am vowing to seek the way of the Patriarchs;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">I will certainly not forget your kindness in the future."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">The guard official observed his determination</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">and did not strictly detain him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">and moreover said to him:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">"Since you are forgetting your body for the sake of the Dharma,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">when you return, I hope you will not be stingy with what you have learned."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">The Master gladly thanked him</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">and went directly to Shūshān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">At that time, Héshàng Rén was sitting in the Dharma hall, receiving students.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:46:30.262+09:00">The Master first looked around at the assembly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">Then he asked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">"What about when you leave in an instant (chànnà)?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">Shūshān said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">"Fú</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">Sè!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">Empty space!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">How will you leave?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">The master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">"Fú Sè is empty space,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">it's better not to leave."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">Shūshān then stopped.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">The master descended from the hall</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">and consulted the head monk.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">The head monk said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">"I just saw the zuòzhǔ's reply to the héshàng,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">the words were quite peculiar."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-14T16:53:25.536+09:00">The master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">"This is presumptuous,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">truly arising from chance.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">I dare to hope for compassion,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">to enlighten my foolish confusion."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">The first monk said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">"Is there still any deliberation within a single moment?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">The master suddenly understood upon hearing these words,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">bowed in gratitude,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">and withdrew to the tea hall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">filled with both sorrow and joy,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">for three days.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">Afterward, he resided at Mount Huángbò,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">gathering a crowd to expound the Dharma.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">(The second abbot).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.58" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.59" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">He eventually passed away at the same mountain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-15T08:00:16.094+09:00">Now, his complete body in the pagoda appears as if alive.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.61" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.62" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">Shǒuchéng Jìngguǒ Dàshī of Hùguó Monastery on Suíchéng Mountain in Suízhōu.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.63" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">Someone asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.64" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"What</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.65" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">is Buddha?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.66" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.67" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"This donkey man."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.68" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">Someone asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.69" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"If the entire great earth is a person within the corner of one's eye,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.70" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">what about the master?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.71" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.72" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"A man below the steps."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.73" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">Someone asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.74" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"Where the Buddhas do not fall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.75" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">what kind of person treads there?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.76" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.77" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"Dān ěr péngtóu."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.78" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">The person said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.79" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"What kind of person can transmit news from that place?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.80" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.81" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"A donkey-faced beast jowls."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.82" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.83" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">" ， 、</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.84" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">" ."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.85" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">Someone asked:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.86" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"What about when one recognizes according to conditions?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.87" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.88" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:44:39.591+09:00">"Wrong."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.89" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Question:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.90" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"What is the meaning of Bodhidharma's coming from the West?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.91" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.92" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"One person transmits falsehood,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.93" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">ten thousand people transmit it as truth."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.94" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Question:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">No need for much reasoning</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">to understand.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">If you see the nature of the Dharma Realm,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">don't make a fuss about it either.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">Treasure it!」</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">He also said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">"In the morning, get up, wash your hands and face, and rinse your mouth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">drink tea;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after drinking tea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">bow before the Buddha;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after bowing before the Buddha,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">inquire at the abbot's/chief monk's office;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after inquiring at the abbot's/chief monk's office,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">practice in the Sangha hall;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after practicing in the Sangha hall,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">go to the hall to eat congee;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after going to the hall to eat congee,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">return to your place and take a nap;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after returning to your place and taking a nap,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">get up, wash your hands and face, and rinse your mouth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after getting up, washing your hands and face, and rinsing your mouth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">drink tea;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after drinking tea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">do this and that;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after doing this and that,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">practice in the Sangha hall at meal time;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after practicing in the Sangha hall at meal time,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">go to the hall to eat rice;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after going to the hall to eat rice,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">rinse your mouth;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after rinsing your mouth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">drink tea;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">after drinking tea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_026-0427a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-16T21:22:39.715+09:00">do this and that;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.95" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"Without resorting to grasping hands,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.96" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">what is the great sword Tà'ā (太阿)?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.97" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.98" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"The light of the seven stars shines brightly,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.99" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">the six states cease their smoky dust (warfare)."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.100" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Chán Master Guīrén (歸仁) of Língquán (靈泉) at Chángshuǐ (長水) Monastery in Luòjīng (洛京).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.101" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Question:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.102" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"What is the meaning of the Patriarch?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.103" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.104" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"Looking up, he alone raises his eyebrows;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.105" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">turning his head, he claps his own hands."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.106" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Question:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.107" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"What is the true meaning of the Patriarch's coming from the West?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.108" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.109" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"The Luò (洛) River flows upstream."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.110" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Question:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.111" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"What is the family style of the monks?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.112" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.113" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"Riding an ox, wearing a straw hat;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.114" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">crossing the water, wearing boots and robes."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.115" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.116" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Chán Master Fènglín (奉璘) of Yánqìng (延慶) Monastery at Fúlóng (伏龍) Mountain in Yánzhōu (延州).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.117" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">Question:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368a.118" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"What is the</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368b.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368b.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">family style of the monks?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368b.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">The master said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_020-0368b.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-06-17T14:51:26.811+09:00">"Lying horizontally in the sea,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">The master then had a great realization and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"The Buddha-dharma is not so complicated!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Yú then grabbed the master's collar and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"Just now you said I didn't understand,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">and now you say it's not so complicated,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">so how much is it?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">How much is it?"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">The master gave Yú a punch in the ribs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Yú pushed him away and said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"Your teacher, Huáng Bò,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">it has nothing to do with me!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">The master then returned to Huáng Bò.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Huáng Bò asked,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"Why did you return so quickly!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">The master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"Just because I was too eager and kind."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Huáng Bò said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"This old fool Dàyú!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Wait until I see him,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">I'll give him a beating."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">The master said,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">"What are you talking about waiting to see me?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">I'll hit you right now!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Thereupon he gave Huáng Bò a slap.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR6q0003_T_012-0290b.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-01T11:41:38.575+09:00">Huáng Bò laughed heartily.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>